		<news>
[B]Update - v6.7.84 - August 18th, 2026 [/B]
--[Enhancement] Added Airlock status and controls to TorBox cloud files, including fresh status after changes.
--[Change] Removed the TorBox Delete All Cloud Files menu item.
--[Fix] Continuous-playback dialogs now fall back to the show rating for unrated episodes.
--[Fix] Standardized direct Progress Episode scraping, refresh, and browse actions across tracking services.
--[Fix] MDBList completed playback no longer leaves a pause point in Progress Episodes.
--[Fix] Reduced MDBList Progress Shows loading time by eliminating duplicate per-show metadata requests.
--[Fix] Progress Episodes from all tracking services now show air information if turned on.
--[Fix] Simkl Progress Episodes now advances after an episode is marked watched.
--[Fix] Continuous playback now preserves a queued third episode at playback end.
--[Fix] Play Random now starts a fresh continuous-playback playlist.
--[Change] Added direct progress scrape settings for new providers. 
--[Fix] Added support for custom lists from Floppy.
--[Change] Success and Fail messages for add and remove from lists.
		</news>
